WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.528
If your money lives in a dozen places—brokers, bank apps, EPF, and gold—you're not alone.

2
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:16.030
Sampatti brings it all into one private picture, on your own computer.

3
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.700
No cloud, no sign-up.

4
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.362
Choose India, and let's load a demo to see how it feels.

5
00:00:26.962 --> 00:00:30.562
The dashboard is your financial home.

6
00:00:31.112 --> 00:00:36.248
At a glance, you see your total net worth and where it sits.

7
00:00:36.798 --> 00:00:47.310
But the real value is in these verdicts—simple, plain-word reads on your equity and liquidity, computed entirely on this device.

8
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:56.998
Open the Performance tab to see what actually matters: did your money grow, or did you just add more?

9
00:00:57.548 --> 00:01:07.292
You can zoom into any period and see your history stacked account by account—built from real purchase costs, not guesses.

10
00:01:08.892 --> 00:01:12.492
The Holdings tab puts you in control.

11
00:01:13.042 --> 00:01:21.226
You can edit any holding, update prices, or exclude an account from your totals with a single click.

12
00:01:21.776 --> 00:01:27.776
To add your own numbers, just drop in a CAS PDF or spreadsheet.

13
00:01:28.326 --> 00:01:34.446
Everything parses right here, and you review every line before it's saved.

14
00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:40.750
Now, the hero feature: AI Analysis.

15
00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:48.764
A SEBI-aware analyst reviews your diversification, tax planning, and retirement.

16
00:01:49.314 --> 00:01:57.426
Sampatti shows you the exact brief before it leaves—a private summary, never your raw statements.

17
00:01:59.026 --> 00:02:03.682
In Settings, you can connect the AI Analyst.

18
00:02:04.232 --> 00:02:09.488
Just paste your secure access code to use our hosted relay.

19
00:02:10.038 --> 00:02:16.350
Your data stays on your device—only the compact brief is sent for review.

20
00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:22.342
Finally, the Privacy page is our contract.

21
00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:25.268
Gone means gone.

22
00:02:25.818 --> 00:02:29.010
One click erases everything.

23
00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.680
Export your data anytime.

24
00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:37.646
It's your wealth, and finally, it's your privacy.

25
00:02:39.246 --> 00:02:41.550
That's Sampatti.

26
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.204
Modern, private portfolio analysis.

27
00:02:46.754 --> 00:02:51.194
Install it tonight and finally see the whole picture.
